{
  "title": "Yummy Light Argentinian Tofu Parrillada",
  "description": "A light, earthy, and snappy Argentinian-style dish featuring tofu, ferment-kimchi, and traditional Argentinean flavors. Serve with crusty bread or as a main course.",
  "cuisine": "Argentinian",
