      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "Freshly squeezed"
    },
    {
      "name": "Olive oil",
      "amount": "1 tbsp",
      "notes": "For brushing tofu"
    },
    {
      "name": "Salt",
      "amount": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Black pepper",
      "amount": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F).",
    "Brush tofu with olive oil and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill tofu for 3-4 minutes per side, or until lightly charred.",
    "Meanwhile, heat 1 tablespoon of olive oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add sliced red onion and red bell pepper, cook for 5 minutes, or until slightly softened.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Stir in ferment-kimchi, chopped cilantro, and lemon juice.",
    "Simmer mixture for 2-3 minutes, or until heated through.",
    "Serve tofu on top of kimchi mixture and garnish with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
